    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with a concentrated offensive profile, anchored by **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, who carries our highest efficiency score of 69.27. Facing Gore, **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** benefits from a substantial platoon advantage and a favorable spot in the heart of the order (#3). The projection model gives him a significant boost here, capitalizing on his ability to drive the ball against left-handed pitching. While our overall lineup depth is tested by off-days for core contributors like **Kyle Tucker** and **Gunnar Henderson**, we are leaning on the tactical efficiency of our remaining active roster to chase R and RBI production.\n\nThe most difficult bench decision involved **Curtis Mead**, who missed the cut with a score of 37.18. Despite the benefit of hitting in the #2 hole, the unfavorable matchup against S\u00e1nchez, C (xERA 2.84) and a negative platoon adjustment caused his projection to fall below our 40.0 \"Zebras\" floor. We opted to start **Nasim Nunez** (41.62) instead, prioritizing his defensive utility and the scarcity value of his speed profile, even though his offensive ceiling is dampened by an elite opposing arm and a lower spot in the batting order. We are continuing to monitor **Luis Robert Jr.** on the IL; until he returns, we must remain disciplined with our bench caps, keeping **Curtis Mead** in reserve to avoid burning points in inefficient matchups. \n\nManagers should keep a close eye on the weather and the finalization of the lower-third lineups, as any late-breaking shifts could push marginal starts like **Nasim Nunez** further into negative territory. With **Kyle Tucker** and **Gunnar Henderson** unavailable, our focus remains on maximizing every plate appearance from **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** to maintain our competitive edge in this 5x5 format. We are positioned to play conservatively with our bench assets today, ensuring we do not exhaust our games-played limits while targeting high-efficiency opportunities against the remaining pitching matchups.",
